{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"7de063fb9703eecb2e48da7f61727eff43ceb7b7e71ec87e971bc17ea0f77c9a","slug":"about.guiding-themes.discovery","location":"/about/guiding-themes/discovery.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Discovery","github":"https://github.com/UC-OSPO-Network/ucospo.net","copyright":"2024","numbering":{"title":{"offset":2}},"source_url":"https://github.com/UC-OSPO-Network/ucospo.net/blob/main/about/guiding-themes/discovery.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/UC-OSPO-Network/ucospo.net/edit/main/about/guiding-themes/discovery.md","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"discovery.md","url":"/build/discovery-4cfedbcd1723a77cd7b0f3dfd8aa2f8f.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The UC OSPO Network’s ","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"BkzyefV8bw"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Discovery Working Group","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"zgj0TEjVk1"}],"key":"cHI790n6JQ"},{"type":"text","value":" is creating tools to map out the open source landscape at the University of California and discover research groups creating open source software throughout the system. These activities enable the network to be the interface between the UC research enterprise and the open source world, informing the UC open source strategy and policy. This Working Group is also undertaking a UC-wide stakeholder survey of open source projects, practices and perceptions. This information will be used to target outreach activities and curate a compelling portfolio of open source projects open to engagement with external sponsors.","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"YiUVs6tKNG"}],"key":"tesafSD21r"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Primary activities under this Working Group include:","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"PqN6ckpdeh"}],"key":"TgQQorWP6b"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"emphasis","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"UC Open Repository Browser (UC ORB)","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"S9k56MuCam"}],"key":"SHM4flHyt1"},{"type":"text","value":": the Network’s instance of ORB, a toolkit for discovering, exploring, and spotlighting the open source software produced across the UC system, built on public repository metadata from providers such as GitHub. UC ORB data helps the Network target outreach and attract external stakeholders interested in supporting UC open source research. The work draws on related efforts including the ","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"wnM8uN5kjY"},{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/numfocus/moss","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Map of Open Source Science","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"FK64aEYX4r"}],"urlSource":"https://github.com/numfocus/moss","error":true,"key":"QHo0n1uqzh"},{"type":"text","value":". The ORB toolkit itself is now an open source project maintained by the ","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"TqD9qaFbZY"},{"type":"link","url":"/about/get-involved/working-groups/orb","position":{"start":{"line":9